      },
      "referred_to_by": {
        "id": "ex:classificatorystatus/0000b5716da804138d730e6e937a184144c7ff10/description",
        "type": "LinguisticObject",
        "content": "The image `0000b5716da804138d730e6e937a184144c7ff10.jpg` was classified as a **machine-produced document** with a confidence of **99.73%**.\n\nThis classification was generated by a fine-tuned **YOLOv11n-cls** model named [`yolo11n-cls-grp.pt`](https://universe.roboflow.com/sariimageannotation/grp-image-classification) (from training run `train42`). The model was trained on the [`grp-image-classification-dataset-v2`](https://universe.roboflow.com/sariimageannotation/grp-image-classification) dataset, which contains 2,183 human-annotated images across eight visual classes.\n\nThis machine-learning pipeline was developed and executed as part of the [SARI Image Classification project](https://universe.roboflow.com/sariimageannotation/grp-image-classification), led by Matteo Romanello, to automatically classify images from the GRP collection for research purposes."
      }
    },
